### 2.3 Proactive Initiative System

**Current state:** Nova is 100% reactive. This kills the friendship feel.

**Plan: 3 types of proactive messages**

#### A — Time-based Check-ins (Cron Job)
```typescript
// Runs via a scheduled job (e.g., every hour)
async function checkInUsers() {
  const users = await prisma.novaUserMemory.findMany({
    where: {
      // Users who haven't chatted in 6-24h
      user: { aiConversations: { some: { messages: { some: { createdAt: { lt: sixHoursAgo } } } } } }
    }
  });

  for (const user of users) {
    const prompt = buildProactivePrompt(user); // see below
    const message = await callGroq(prompt);
    await saveProactiveMessage(user.userId, message);
    // Push to frontend via WebSocket/SSE
  }
}
```

#### B — Context-triggered Proactivity (Smart Interjections)
| Trigger | Nova's Action |
|---|---|
| User completed a Soul Game episode | "I noticed something interesting about your choices..." |
| User got a new match | "I think you'll connect well with this person because..." |
| Big Five score updated | "Your personality evolved since we last talked..." |
| User hasn't messaged in 1 day | "Hey, I was wondering how your [last topic] turned out" |
| User logged in for the first time today | Morning greeting adapted to emotional trend |

#### C — Personality-driven Random Initiative (makes Nova feel alive)
```typescript
const PROACTIVE_TEMPLATES = {
  NEW: [
    "I'm still learning about you — what's something you genuinely love?",
    "What kind of people do you usually connect with?",
  ],
  FAMILIAR: [
    "You mentioned [last topic] a while back. Did it go the way you hoped?",
    "I've been thinking about what you said about [insight]. It stayed with me.",
  ],
  FRIEND: [
    "Random thought — [inside joke or reference]. Remember that?",
    "Something reminded me of you today. Weird, right? I don't know what to do with that.",
  ],
  CLOSE: [
    "I notice when you're not here. Is everything okay?",
    "I think I know what you're going to say before you say it. Prove me wrong.",
  ],
};
```

