## 3. Data Tables Summary

| Table | Purpose | Key Fields |
|---|---|---|
| `AIConversation` | One per user, holds summary | `userId`, `summary` |
| `AIMessage` | Each message row | `role`, `content`, `emotionDetected`, `isProactive` |
| `NovaUserMemory` *(new)* | Structured fast-lookup profile | `trustLevel`, `friendshipStage`, `topInterests`, `currentStruggles`, `insideJokes`, `lastTopicDiscussed` |
| `PersonalityProfile` | Big Five scores | `openness`, `extraversion`, etc. |
| `GameResponse` | Soul Game choices | `choice.text`, `choice.valueCategory` |

**Lookup Algorithm — Which table to query when:**
```
User sends message
  ├── Always: NovaUserMemory (identity, trust, stage, emotional trend) → O(1) by userId index
  ├── Always: AIMessage last 20 (short-term memory) → O(log n) by conversationId + createdAt index
  ├── If summary exists: AIConversation.summary (long-term blob) → O(1)
  ├── If topic matches personality: PersonalityProfile → O(1) by userId
  └── If topic matches games/values: GameResponse last 5 → O(log n)
```

